    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Kamu adalah asisten penerjemah dan pengolah data.\nBerikut data partner ngobrol bahasa Inggris:\n- Nama: \"{{ $json.Person }}\"\n- Gender : {{ $json.Gender }}\n- Negara: \"{{ $json.Country }}\"\n- Topik Obrolan (English): \"{{ $json.Topics }}\"\n- Chit Chat : \"{{ $json['Feedback / Chit-chat Notes'] }}\"\n- Kontak: \"{{ $json['Social Media / WhatsApp (Jika Ada)'] }}\"\n\nTugasmu:\n1. Terjemahkan teks 'Topik Obrolan' ke dalam Bahasa Indonesia yang natural dan mudah dipahami.\n2. Standarisasi nama negara ke bahasa Inggris baku (misal \"Columbia\" -> \"Colombia\", \"Srilangka\" -> \"Sri Lanka\").\n3. Berikan emoji bendera negara yang sesuai (contoh: 🇵🇦 / 🇲🇽 / 🇱🇰 / 🇨🇴 / 🇻🇳).\n\nKembalikan HANYA JSON murni tanpa markdown:\n{\n  \"person\": \"{{ $json.Person }}\",\n  \"gender\" : \"{{ $json.Gender }}\n  \"standard_country\": \"Nama negara baku bahasa Inggris\",\n  \"flag\": \"Emoji bendera\",\n  \"feedback\" : \"{{ $json['Feedback / Chit-chat Notes'] }}\"\n  \"topics_en\": \"{{ $json.Topics }}\",\n  \"topics_id\": \"Terjemahan topik ke bahasa Indonesia yang natural\",\n  \"social_media\": \"{{ $json['Social Media / WhatsApp (Jika Ada)'] }}\"\n}",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        -80,
        0
      ],
      "id": "4f5546a7-33ab-4b89-9157-b9c3c4e29d3c",
      "name": "Basic LLM Chain",
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-3.1-flash-lite",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        240
      ],
      "id": "e4330855-3de5-45e2-91c2-2990f56a6edc",
      "name": "Google Gemini Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "LbGqYGsX4XH35zyS",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "for (const item of $input.all()) {\n  try {\n    const rawText = item.json.text || \"\";\n    const cleanJson = rawText.replace(/```json/gi, \"\").replace(/```/g, \"\").trim();\n    const parsed = JSON.parse(cleanJson);\n\n    item.json.Person = parsed.person || item.json.Person || \"-\";\n    item.json.Country = parsed.standard_country || item.json.Country || \"-\";\n    item.json.Flag = parsed.flag || \"🌐\";\n    item.json.Topics_EN = parsed.topics_en || item.json.Topics || \"-\";\n    item.json.Topics_ID = parsed.topics_id || \"-\";\n    item.json.SocialMedia = parsed.social_media || item.json['Social Media / WhatsApp (Jika Ada)'] || \"-\";\n    item.json.Feedback = parsed.feedback || item.json['Feedback / Chit-chat Notes\": \"feedback'] || \"-\";\n  } catch (err) {\n    item.json.Person = item.json.Person || \"-\";\n    item.json.Country = item.json.Country || \"-\";\n    item.json.Flag = \"🌐\";\n    item.json.Topics_EN = item.json.Topics || \"-\";\n    item.json.Topics_ID = \"-\";\n    item.json.Feedback = item.json['Feedback / Chit-chat Notes\": \"feedback']\n    item.json.SocialMedia = item.json['Social Media / WhatsApp (Jika Ada)'] || \"-\";\n  }\n\n  // Rating dari form\n  item.json.MeetAgain = item.json['Want to meet again?'] || \"-\";\n\n  // Waktu Jakarta\n  item.json.Timestamp = new Date().toLocaleString(\"id-ID\", {\n    timeZone: \"Asia/Jakarta\",\n    dateStyle: \"medium\",\n    timeStyle: \"short\"\n  });\n}\n\nreturn $input.all();"
      },
